- Hala.

795
00:48:44,421 --> 00:48:45,714
Seok-jin.

796
00:48:45,797 --> 00:48:47,215
¿Cómo es posible?

797
00:48:47,299 --> 00:48:49,259
A, D, H.

798
00:48:50,594 --> 00:48:51,428
Correcto.

799
00:48:53,013 --> 00:48:54,056
Uno, dos y dos.

800
00:48:54,139 --> 00:48:56,141
A, D, H.

801
00:49:01,855 --> 00:49:02,773
ORBIT.

802
00:49:04,858 --> 00:49:05,817
Q, R, S.

803
00:49:07,027 --> 00:49:08,236
Correcto.

804
00:49:08,320 --> 00:49:10,238
Esto es estresante.

805
00:49:11,073 --> 00:49:13,450
- Yo no diría ni una.
- Ni yo.

806
00:49:21,833 --> 00:49:23,085
ORBIT.

807
00:49:23,168 --> 00:49:24,086
Vamos.

808
00:49:25,087 --> 00:49:26,004
H, I, J.

809
00:49:26,838 --> 00:49:27,964
¿H, I, J?

810
00:49:29,800 --> 00:49:31,093
Incorrecto.

811
00:49:39,142 --> 00:49:40,018
Seok-jin.

812
00:49:42,104 --> 00:49:43,146
I, J, K.

813
00:49:45,023 --> 00:49:45,941
Incorrecto.

814
00:49:50,028 --> 00:49:50,987
No estoy seguro.

815
00:49:52,114 --> 00:49:54,866
Tengo dudas
porque no confío en mi memoria.

816
00:49:54,950 --> 00:49:56,868
Ante la duda, mejor no decir nada.

817
00:49:56,952 --> 00:49:58,286
Sí, podría ser mejor.

818
00:50:04,543 --> 00:50:07,838
Como nadie ha pulsado
el pulsador en 90 segundos,

819
00:50:07,921 --> 00:50:09,423
